    "question": "Your selection committee is considering two projects. They can choose only one or the other. Project A\u2019s expected cash inflows are $14,000. It has a payback period of 14 months, and IRR equals 4 percent. Project B expects cash inflows of $5,000 per quarter for the first 16 months, and its IRR is 2. Which project should the selection committee choose and why?",
