    "chapter": "Chapter 5: Full-Length Practice Exam 2",
    "originalNumber": 121,
    "question": "Marysil recently accepted a new role as lead project manager within a well-established healthcare company. Over the past three months she has worked hard to introduce new concepts and styles into the environment. She approaches every situation by considering purpose, people, and process\u2014in that order. What type of leadership style does Marysil follow?",
