    "question": "Tom is a project manager working for a reputable editorial agency specializing in exam preparation. As part of his latest project, he uses an approach that enables the team to release partially completed work to customers in order to obtain early feedback. This then allows the team to use the feedback to modify the work. What type of project life cycle is Tom using?",
