    "explanation": "The Expectancy Theory states that employees who believe that more effort will lead to better performance, which will then lead to rewards that they personally value, will continue to be productive. This is a conscious choice; otherwise, if they don\u2019t value the rewards, their incentive to be productive is lost.",
