    "explanation": "Knowledge can be split into two types: explicit or tacit. Explicit knowledge can be captured and expressed using words, pictures, and numbers; tacit knowledge is more difficult to capture or express, such as beliefs, experiences, and \u201cknow-how.\u201d",
