    "chapter": "Chapter 6: Full-Length Practice Exam 3",
    "originalNumber": 100,
    "question": "A project manager plots the degree of certainty and complexity of a project along x- and y-axes to determine what type of project management approach would suit the project best. The exercise reveals that the project falls within the \u201ccomplex\u201d quadrant due to moderately uncertain requirements and highly uncertain technical challenges. What model is the project manager using?",
