    "question": "Sally, a member of the project management team, walks into a room where two project team members are seen arguing over the schedule. One team member feels that an additional resource is needed to meet an upcoming deadline, while another feels that the risk is not as high and that the schedule should be left alone. Sally takes a moment to review the schedule and instructs the team members to leave it. What type of resolution technique did Sally use?",
