    "chapter": "Chapter 6: Full-Length Practice Exam 3",
    "originalNumber": 128,
    "question": "The project manager had received two complaints that three project team members were arguing over the interpretation of schedule analysis results conducted the previous day. The project manager had waited to see whether they would work it out among themselves, but another two complaints were made that the situation was affecting the work of others. What should the project manager do?",
